                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I spend over 2 hours trying to get this game to work, even using AI to try to speed things along, but besides the opening mpegs it just doesn't seem to want to function. Anything that takes this long to fix really shouldn't be recommended. \n\nHowever, after they're done doing to Killing Moon Remaster (AN ACTUAL REMASTER, THIS OVERSEER IS NOT THE REMASTER), and then they'll likely follow up with a Pandora Directive Remaster and then the Overseer Remaster, but that could take years. I suggest waiting for that or until they patch this one.",
